# The race options' values (arcade, ordered race): a screenshot after each change of weather and time of day.
include boot-to-roam.pad
wait 1s 60f
press start 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
press a 4f
wait 2500ms 150f
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
